:false},"created_at":"2025-06-02T16:24:49Z","updated_at":"2025-06-02T16:24:49Z","body":"I am also getting corrupted files from my windows machine\n\nGodot Engine v4.4.1.stable.official.49a5bc7b6 - https://godotengine.org\nOpenGL API 3.3.0 - Build 31.0.101.2115 - Compatibility - Using Device: Intel - Intel(R) UHD Graphics 620\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2931478705/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2931539092","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105778#issuecomment-2931539092","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105778","id":2931539092,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uu7yU","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-02T16:40:53Z","updated_at":"2025-06-02T16:41:32Z","body":"ffprobe output on the MRP's output (when enabling **Movie Quit on Finish** and letting it quit):\n\n```\n[mjpeg @ 0000018d5618e580] EOI missing, emulating\nInput #0, avi, from '.\\godot-export2.avi':\n  Duration: 00:00:08.52, start: 0.000000, bitrate: 10707 kb/s\n  Stream #0:0: Video: mjpeg (Baseline) (MJPG / 0x47504A4D), yuvj420p(pc, bt470bg/unknown/unknown), 1152x648 [SAR 1:1 DAR 16:9], 7626 kb/s, 60 fps, 60 tbr, 60 tbn\n  Stream #0:1: Audio: pcm_s32le ([1][0][0][0] / 0x0001), 48000 Hz, 2 channels, s32, 3072 kb/s\n```\n\nThe first line of the output denotes a missing footer in the file. I'm not sure why this is occurring, considering it normally works. The issue also occurs with 4.3.stable, so it's not specific to 4.4.\n\nPS: For those downloading the MRP, remember to change the movie path in the project settings so it can write correctly.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2931539092/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3150337716","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105778#issuecomment-3150337716","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105778","id":3150337716,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67xla0","user":{"login":"berarma","id":162766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mjc2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma","html_url":"https://github.com/berarma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-04T12:04:10Z","updated_at":"2025-08-04T19:33:32Z","body":"The AVI file footer isn't missing. The EOI is a part of the JPEG image for every frame. It seems the EOI is missing in the first frame of the video. What's weird is that even when re-encoding this file with FFmpeg the problem is still there, so it might be a red herring.\n\nWhich errors does Youtube throw?\n\nEdit: I've checked and the EOI marker is there but FFmpeg seems to skip over it by one byte. It looks like an off-by-one error in a pointer calculation but I can't confirm. Anyway, I would focus on the issues with Youtube and the other players.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3150337716/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3177035135","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105778#issuecomment-3177035135","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105778","id":3177035135,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69XbV_","user":{"login":"berarma","id":162766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mjc2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma","html_url":"https://github.com/berarma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-11T22:07:30Z","updated_at":"2025-08-11T22:07:30Z","body":"Confirmed that the EOI error is a [bug in FFmpeg](https://code.ffmpeg.org/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/issues/20119). I've tested with the fix that has already been merged in FFmpeg and the error message is gone. The generated AVI file looks good.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3177035135/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3177341548","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105778#issuecomment-3177341548","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105778","id":3177341548,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69YmJs","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-12T00:56:49Z","updated_at":"2025-08-12T00:57:34Z","body":"Closing per @berarma's comment, as this is a bug in FFmpeg rather than Godot.\n\nThe FFmpeg bug was fixed by https://code.ffmpeg.org/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/pulls/20219, but as of writing, it's not in any release yet. Therefore, you'll have to use a nightly build to benefit from it.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3177341548/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]